        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Terror Call is a chilling first-person horror experience where fear, puzzles, and survival collide.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned rooms, uncover cryptic clues, and navigate dark environments filled with unsettling sounds and sudden jump scares. Every location hides secrets, and every decision can bring you closer to escape—or deeper into danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by regional horror storytelling, <strong>Terror Call</strong> blends cultural atmosphere with universally terrifying gameplay. With immersive audio, intelligent puzzles, and constant psychological tension, the game keeps you on edge from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are not a hero. You are a survivor.</strong><br><strong>Answer the call—if you dare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584910/extras/babef2135babd4de62c252e9f9f7ec05.avif?t=1768885192\" width=1584 height=396 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Voice Acting</strong><br>Fully voice-acted experience with subtitle support for global players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Through Environmental Hints</strong><br>Discover cryptic notes and visual clues that slowly reveal the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fear That Follows You</strong><br>Dynamic jump scares, unsettling whispers, and footsteps in the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Puzzle Design</strong><br>Every room hides a secret. Observation and logic are your only allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Escapes</strong><br>Doors, keys, and locks with more than one possible way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive First-Person Horror</strong><br>You are not just playing the game—you are inside it.</p></li></ul>",
